# Generated paths and the RetroArch playlist are installed by install_lakka_ui.py.
# The dashboard runs on /dev/fb0; it does not start a web server.
# Launch: systemctl start wifi-classifier.service
# Return: physical B button, or systemctl stop wifi-classifier.service
# Returning/stopping starts retroarch.service again.
# Installing does not change the default boot target or enable the dashboard at boot.
